#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Charlotte keeps the "
"firm running, from client scheduling to the details that make sure nothing "
"falls through the cracks. She's often the first person a new client speaks "
"to."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Charlotte assure le "
"bon fonctionnement du cabinet, de la planification des rendez-vous clients "
"aux détails qui permettent de ne rien laisser au hasard. Elle est souvent la "
"première personne à qui s'adresse un nouveau client."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Confidentiality<br/"
">\n"
"                                                        &amp;amp; Trust"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Confidentialité<br/>"
"\n"
"                                                        &amp;amp; Confiance"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Edward is Richard "
"Whitemore's son and Edward Whitemore Sr.'s grandson. He took over the firm's "
"leadership in 2009 and has spent his career advising local business owners "
"on the decisions that shape their companies. He still takes on client "
"matters personally, alongside guiding the firm's next generation."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Edward est le fils "
"de Richard Whitemore et le petit-fils d'Edward Whitemore Sr. Il a repris la "
"direction du cabinet en 2009 et a consacré sa carrière à conseiller les "
"entrepreneurs locaux sur les décisions qui façonnent leurs entreprises. Il "
"continue de traiter personnellement les dossiers de ses clients, tout en "
"accompagnant la nouvelle génération du cabinet."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Expertise&amp;nbsp;"
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        &amp;amp; Experience"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        "
"Expertise&amp;nbsp;<br/>\n"
"                                                        &amp;amp; Expérience"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Isabelle advises the "
"firm on employment law and business disputes, drawing on twenty years of "
"experience before joining Whitemore &amp;amp; Sons in 2020. She works "
"closely with the firm's partners on matters that call for a second, more "
"senior opinion."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Isabelle conseille "
"le cabinet en droit du travail et en contentieux commercial, forte de vingt "
"ans d'expérience avant de rejoindre Whitemore &amp;amp; Sons en 2020. Elle "
"travaille en étroite collaboration avec les associés du cabinet sur les "
"dossiers nécessitant un second avis plus expérimenté."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Julian works across "
"the firm's contract and corporate governance matters, supporting clients "
"from first engagement through closing. He's known for being the person "
"clients can always reach with a quick question."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Julian intervient "
"sur les contrats et les questions de gouvernance d'entreprise du cabinet, "
"accompagnant les clients de la prise en charge initiale jusqu'à la "
"conclusion des opérations. Il est connu pour être toujours disponible "
"lorsque les clients ont une question rapide."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Margaret leads the "
"firm's corporate and transactional practice, advising clients on formation, "
"contracts, and mergers and acquisitions. She joined the firm in 2015 after "
"seven years at a larger Brussels firm, and now leads much of the firm's day "
"to day client work."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Margaret dirige le "
"département de droit des sociétés et des opérations transactionnelles du "
"cabinet, conseillant les clients en matière de constitution de sociétés, de "
"contrats et de fusions-acquisitions. Elle a rejoint le cabinet en 2015 après "
"sept années dans un grand cabinet bruxellois et supervise aujourd'hui une "
"grande partie des dossiers clients courants."

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Personalized&amp;nbsp;"
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Service"
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        "
"Service&amp;nbsp;<br/>\n"
"                                                        personnalisé"

#. module: industry_lawyer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:industry_lawyer.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Thomas handles the "
"firm's mergers and acquisitions and corporate governance matters, working "
"closely with Margaret on the firm's larger transactions. He joined the firm "
"in 2017 and is known for staying on a deal through the smallest details, "
"right up to closing."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                                        Thomas traite les "
"dossiers de fusions-acquisitions et de gouvernance d'entreprise du cabinet, "
"en étroite collaboration avec Margaret sur les opérations les plus "
"importantes. Il a rejoint le cabinet en 2017 et est reconnu pour son suivi "
"rigoureux des moindres détails d'une opération jusqu'à sa conclusion."

